sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant GW as API Gateway (:8080)
    participant US as User Service (:8081)
    participant PS as Product Service (:8082)
    participant OS as Order Service (:8083)
    participant Broker as Kafka Broker (:9092)
    participant NS as Notification Service (:8084)

    Customer->>GW: POST /api/users/login
    GW->>US: Validate Credentials
    US-->>GW: Return Signed JWT Bearer Token
    GW-->>Customer: 200 OK + JWT

    Customer->>GW: GET /api/products
    GW->>PS: Query Products (Check Redis L2)
    PS-->>Customer: 200 OK (Product Catalog List)

    Customer->>GW: POST /api/orders/checkout (with JWT)
    GW->>OS: Validate Token & Forward Order Request
    OS->>PS: POST /decrement-stock (Atomic Reservation)
    PS-->>OS: 200 OK (Stock Deducted)
    OS->>Broker: Publish OrderEvent (topic: order-events)
    OS-->>Customer: 201 Created (Order #79 status: PLACED)

    Broker->>NS: Consume OrderEvent (groupId: notification-group)
    NS->>NS: Check Deduplication (processed_events)
    NS-->>NS: Simulated Dispatch & Audit Log
